{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and Marco's First Argument", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Girl With a Suitcase", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 12, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe  routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Present Perfect Tense vs. The Simple Past Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span> tense to talk about a finished action or event that is connected to the present in some way.</p> You use the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past</span> tense to talk about a finished action or event <span class=\"strong\">not</span> necessarily connected to the present.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span> tense to talk about experience. When you use the <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span> tense, you think about the past and present together. There is some connection between what happened in the past and now.</p> For example:</br> <span class=\"strong\">I have learned</span> English = I learned English in the past and now I can speak English.</br> <span class=\"strong\">He has bought</span> a painting = He bought the painting in the past and now he has a painting. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "We use <span class=\"strong\">have/has</span> + <span class=\"strong\">the past participle</span> of the verb in Present Perfect sentences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past participle form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"go\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"went\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"gone\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">I have gone</span> to Japan.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lose\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lost\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lost\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">He's lost</span> all sense of self.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"feel\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"felt\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"felt\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">I have never felt</span> so humiliated.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"decide\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"decided\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"decided\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">I've decided</span> I need a break.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Used to and Would to Talk About Past Habits", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use the expressions <span class=\"strong\">used to</span> and <span class=\"strong\">would</span> to talk about events or activities that were usual or repetitive in the past. You may use them to describe past routines.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">used to</span> with all types of verbs, including general condition or specific actions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">I never used to behave like this.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You used <span class=\"strong\">would</span> when there is a specific time for the action to happen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<span class=\"italic\"> <br/>In San Francisco, I would play our reunion over and over in my head.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For the negative form of <span class=\"strong\">used to</span>, you use the auxiliary verb <span class=\"strong\">did</span>; the form is <span class=\"strong\">didn't use</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<span class=\"italic\"> <br/>I <span class=\"strong\">didn't use</span> to behave like this.</span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to pack", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to put things in a suitcase or bag for a trip", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm in my bedroom, packing my suitcase.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use in an argument.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "humiliated", "type": "name"}, {"content": "feeling embarrassed or ashamed", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've never felt so humiliated.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "reunion", "type": "name"}, {"content": "when two or more people come together after a long period of time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I would play our reunion over and over in my head.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "toiletries", "type": "name"}, {"content": "things used to take care of your body (soap, shampoo etc.)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You're taking your clothes and toiletries.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to think things through", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to consider things carefully", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I need a break...just to think things through. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to crash", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to sleep at someone's house", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You are welcome to crash here.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le12ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Imagine you have had an argument and you have decided to take a break.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down 10 things you would take with you. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your items with your partner and explain why you would take those things.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask follow-up questions to keep the conversation going.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write down 10 things that I would take with me.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share the list with my partner and discuss why I would take those things.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask follow up questions to keep the conversation going.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le12ob09re2img06.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le12ob09re2img06.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Vanessa? Where are you? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm in my bedroom, packing my suitcase.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: What? What do you mean? You can't leave!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I've never felt so humiliated. This happened in San Francisco, too!"}, {"image": "engenn6le12ob09re2img06.jpg", "time": "13000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: I never used to behave like this ... I don't know what's happening to me. I've totally lost my sense of self!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I think you know exactly who you are and you've only lost your mind!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: In San Francisco, I would play our reunion over and over in my head. I never imagined it would be like this!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, I used to think you were the one, but now I don't know."}, {"image": "engenn6le12ob09re2img07.jpg", "time": "34400", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: You're taking your clothes, hairdryer, toiletries, shoes ... how long are you going for? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm not sure. I've decided I need a break ... just to think things through. You are welcome to crash here.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Without you ... ? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I think you need the time to think, too. You can't behave like this, Marco. If you need me, I have my cell. Good bye!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le12ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le12ob09re2img06.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about past habits.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about what I did.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can discuss experiences I've had or haven't had. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "When you have a big decision to make, what helps you think? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Where do you like to spend time alone?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "I need some time to think.", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa decides she needs a break. What did Marco <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">play over and over</span> in his head?", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"content": [{"content": "To <span class=\"italic\">\"play something over and over\"</span> means to think about it a lot.", "tip_id": 0, "type": "text"}], "type": "tips"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio.", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "select